reset
open EFA-001 concurrency "claim under test"
add EFA-001 for static
mark EFA-001 control_flow done
mark EFA-001 caller done
mark EFA-001 counterevidence done
mark EFA-001 reachability done
mark EFA-001 dynamic unknown
reach EFA-001 proven
verdict EFA-001 confirmed high true
mark EFA-001 wrapper done
add EFA-001 against static
reach EFA-001 not_reachable
verdict EFA-001 confirmed high true
verdict EFA-001 disproved none false
verdict EFA-001 disproved high false
finalize
